"""Correction 01 of 2026-10-26_add-core-services: the core service form (one name, resources in a row, NIC 2 gateway,
routes with NIC and metric, ssh port and secrets of the service, an image), host names of the VMs, how an image is
customized (context or ssh). Data: "managed by" goes into the description, NIC 1 routes become routes, the ssh port
and secret come from the service's first host/VM, the VyOS services get their platform's VyOS image; the images with a
role (VyOS, native router) are customized through the context."""
